Using the previous definition, we define a sensitivity index $S^i_V$ by:
  \begin{align*}
      S_i^{V}:&=1-\frac{\mathbb{E} \left[ \operatorname{VMD}(\Gamma | U_i) \right]}{\operatorname{VMD}(\Gamma)}\\
      &=1-\frac{\mathbb{E}[\lambda(\Gamma \Delta Q^i_{0.5})]}{\mathbb{E}[\lambda(\Gamma \Delta Q_{0.5})]}
  \end{align*}
